Pat v0.16.0 packet-client handshake adjustment

In connect.go, change the exchange call to make AX.25 transports client-initiated:

    clientInitiated := strings.HasPrefix(url.Scheme, MethodAX25)
    err = exchange(conn, url.Target, clientInitiated)

In wl2k-go/fbb/handshake.go, accept a secure challenge without a server SID
and return immediately when a client-initiated session receives `;PQ`.

The resulting ARM64 binary is pat-winlink-n0jcg. Telnet and non-AX.25
transports retain Pat's original server-led handshake behavior.
